Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.91,0:00:04.93,Flashback,FRIEDRICH,0,0,0,,Con nhất định phải trốn thoát, dù chỉ có một mình.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:07.15,Flashback,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Nhưng... Cha ơi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.21,Flashback,FRIEDRICH,0,0,0,,Cha sẽ mãi yêu con, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.34,Flashback,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Cha ơi! Cha ơi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.74,Flashback,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Cha ơi! Cha ơi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:20.54,Flashback,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Cha ơi! Cha ơi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:53.04,Flashback,CHRIS,0,0,0,,Cha ơi!
